OL,3,ATrump administration illegally
OL,4,Aretaliated against Anthropic, judge
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS district judge Rita Lin said in the
OL,8,Fruling that citing national security
OL,9,F"is not a blank check to punish and
OL,10,Fretaliate against government critics".
OL,12,FAnthropic welcomed the ruling. The BBC
OL,13,Fhas contacted the Pentagon and the
OL,14,FWhite House for comment.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
